+
+---
+
+## 0. Where things stand
+
+| | Status |
+|---|---|
+| Pipeline bugs A1–A5 (`perturb.py`, `make_tables.py`) | Ported and tested. Every sweep regenerated. Matches the reanalysis to float precision (section 8). |
+| Missing paper sources (A7) | `tables_similar.tex` and `tables_not_computed.tex` reconstructed from the PDF. OPT-P "correlation 0.80" removed. |
+| LaTeX source | Reflowed to one line per paragraph. Content is unchanged (checked token by token, and by compiling). |
+| Robustness analyses | New folder `step5_robustness/`: exhaustive search, bootstrap with TopCoW MR/CT paired by patient, holdouts, cap sensitivity, junction-displacement sweep, numerics. |
