+---
+
+## 1. Headline claims: what survives
+
+| Claim in `main_v4.tex` | Verdict | What the paper can say instead |
+|---|---|---|
+| NetMets geom. F1 (or ASCD), endpoint F1 and **total length** are the minimal set (abstract, l. 331–337, 378, 384) | **Not supported.** Total length enters only through circular pairs. Under the analytical exclusion it is in no best triplet, at any cap, in any bootstrap replicate. | **Endpoint F1 plus one curve-distance metric (ASCD or NetMets geom. F1)** is the core that holds at every cap. The **third** metric depends on the cap: junction F1 at cap 4, branch coverage F1 at caps 2 and 1. |
